{"id":"ac58a4b542040e38","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-keyword-matching-correctness.md","title":"前缀匹配自动机识别含关键词的词","display":"thm-keyword-matching-correctness — 前缀匹配自动机识别含关键词的词","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-keyword-matching-correctness","aliases":["73-thm-keyword-matching-correctness"],"display":"thm-keyword-matching-correctness — 前缀匹配自动机识别含关键词的词","depends_on":["[[73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton]]","[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.4, print pp. 65–68; PDF pp. 87–90; local invariant and correctness","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-keyword-matching-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-keyword-matching-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-keyword-matching-correctness — 前缀匹配自动机识别含关键词的词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e19221f4363bbadf\" href=\"?note=e19221f4363bbadf\" title=\"73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton\">73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.4, print pp. 65–68; PDF pp. 87–90; local invariant and correctness"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,A_K,P_K,\\top\">\\(K,A_K,P_K,\\top\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e19221f4363bbadf\" href=\"?note=e19221f4363bbadf\" title=\"73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton\">73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(A_K)=\\Sigma^*K\\Sigma^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(A_K)=\\Sigma^*K\\Sigma^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w\\notin\\Sigma^*K\\Sigma^*\\Longrightarrow\n\\widehat\\delta_{A_K}(\\varepsilon,w)=\\iota v\\in P_K\\;\\bigl[(\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uv=w)\\land\n\\forall z\\in P_K\\;((\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uz=w)\\Longrightarrow |z|\\le|v|)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w\\notin\\Sigma^*K\\Sigma^*\\Longrightarrow\n\\widehat\\delta_{A_K}(\\varepsilon,w)=\\iota v\\in P_K\\;\\bigl[(\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uv=w)\\land\n\\forall z\\in P_K\\;((\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uz=w)\\Longrightarrow |z|\\le|v|)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按已读词长归纳。尚未命中时，所有可能将来补成关键词的后缀均是已保留最长后缀的后缀；加一个字符后的最长候选因此可只从当前状态算出。一旦某个关键词成为后缀便进入 ⊤，以后保持接受。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e19221f4363bbadf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e19221f4363bbadf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K,A_K,P_K,\\top$ 采用 [[73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K,A_K,P_K,\\top","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"L(A_K)=\\Sigma^*K\\Sigma^*.","display":true},{"tex":"w\\notin\\Sigma^*K\\Sigma^*\\Longrightarrow\n\\widehat\\delta_{A_K}(\\varepsilon,w)=\\iota v\\in P_K\\;\\bigl[(\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uv=w)\\land\n\\forall z\\in P_K\\;((\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uz=w)\\Longrightarrow |z|\\le|v|)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-keyword-matching-correctness|前缀匹配自动机识别含关键词的词]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["e19221f4363bbadf","3b7a967565c86f39"]}